{"title":"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(slightly_simpler)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (slightly simpler)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Positive real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/4/2a4ecb65de08c1bf479a1947129ae25b83e78bd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/f/f5fb8a1bfebc99aa50758865d7cc84daa663ac7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y \\neq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/d/36d1acdc265dc6f195893d408688ac397e9fdc15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2{x} = \\log_y{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"120\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d665f0d0c8eb91dc18a05aa6742ed6c8eaf365a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/8/c98c62d49698a55a97e4c13b09e9d5855d03f6b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_2{\\tfrac{x}{y}})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"65\" height=\"23\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/f/29f75d21f439869f18d0f682efe28b3ec7ea2463.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\frac{25}{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 20 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } \\frac{45}{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 25 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"406\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/0/26077fe0cd0e9b7374589fcd2e9a2db9f24df7a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2{x} = \\log_y{16}=k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"155\" height=\"19\" />, so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/1/a411b0864d2f88348df2af5c8e439f63210c0b97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^k=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/b/83baa37c5830d781ff4d9e52fa61d06f6c9dc3f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^k=16 \\implies y=2^{\\frac{4}{k}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"161\" height=\"21\" />. Then we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/0/bb00531d0f1e47de891c5427cd2b3a093a63024d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2^k)(2^{\\frac{4}{k}})=2^{k+\\frac{4}{k}}=2^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"167\" height=\"22\" />.\n</p><p>We therefore have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/c/8ccaaf9be36bb015dc8bf49f298d9c605e83617b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k+\\frac{4}{k}=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"79\" height=\"37\" />, and deduce <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/8/9580bb55b19ad880ecd69896e26f78305b0205b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^2-6k+4=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"16\" />. The solutions to this are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/b/23bd6f45ea3d0a0672188d342810d63ac1f5c173.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 3 \\pm \\sqrt{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>To solve the problem, we now find \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/e/46ed77e3d87b6098d7519d0212977a30c112d3f5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (\\log_2\\tfrac{x}{y})^2&amp;=(\\log_2 x - \\log_2 y)^2\\\\ &amp;=(k-\\tfrac{4}{k})^2=(3 \\pm \\sqrt{5} - \\tfrac{4}{3 \\pm \\sqrt{5}})^2 \\\\ &amp;= (3 \\pm \\sqrt{5} - [3 \\mp \\sqrt{5}])^2\\\\ &amp;= (3 \\pm \\sqrt{5} - 3 \\pm \\sqrt{5})^2\\\\ &amp;=(\\pm 2\\sqrt{5})^2 \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 20}. \\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"315\" height=\"181\" />\n~Edits by BakedPotato66\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28slightly_simpler.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(slightly_simpler)\">Solution 2 (slightly simpler)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (slightly simpler)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After obtaining <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/f/35f2a13ebcd3b67f647c5f998cae4de5b027a855.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k + \\frac{4}{k} = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"79\" height=\"37\" />, notice that the required answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/d/a6d14658200edcdae2e586179252b916d4817f9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(k - \\frac{4}{k}\\right)^{2} = k^2 - 8 + \\frac{16}{k^2} = \\left(k^2 + 8 + \\frac{16}{k^2}\\right) - 16 = \\left(k+\\frac{4}{k}\\right)^2 - 16 = 6^2 - 16 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"697\" height=\"48\" />, as before.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the given data, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/1/a0107429065c42ce0622fc2a34d895207240fb65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2(x) = \\frac{1}{\\log_{16}(y)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"147\" height=\"43\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/e/2de9ce44c512e34a5205075c95cff5362632bd6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2(x) = \\frac{4}{{\\log_{2}(y)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"136\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52efc1b69f577782e4c0d876a97d11c7b3955da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy=64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/b/e8bba58882053511a8ee856bd32be6f73baeae5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x= \\frac{64}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"55\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/3/0e3efb423a6a5c5fa986143dfd99809b9e16eda4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2\\left(\\frac{64}{y}\\right) = \\frac{4}{{\\log_{2}(y)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"167\" height=\"45\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/1/c41a9e03f6c591eb1df962c76cdc79c185d15829.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6-\\log_2(y) = \\frac{4}{{\\log_{2}(y)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"167\" height=\"41\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/1/b61d4b2e47999a3746add7bd4caa367d62da49c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6(\\log_2(y))-(\\log_2(y))^2=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"209\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/1/4d167956920987ac7e7f8b73c4e428300d63e3cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" />, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/4/c841f30d20298858846616593732300b5dc504fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2(y)=3+\\sqrt{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Easy resubstitution further gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/5/8958e207ce0ab151c89701f3cfe858f4ba299558.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2(x)=\\frac{4}{3+\\sqrt{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"137\" height=\"41\" />. Simplifying, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/b/50b8c874171301aca9825cae8e279a539fde4052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2(x)= 3-\\sqrt{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Looking back at the original problem, we have What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/8/c98c62d49698a55a97e4c13b09e9d5855d03f6b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_2{\\tfrac{x}{y}})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"65\" height=\"23\" />?\n</p><p>Deconstructing this expression using log rules, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/e/b3e53b4d48772f8ca71152d35f4026f838aef4f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_2{x}-\\log_2{y})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"130\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in our known values, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/e/a1ec3a394de547b7400c62597e4a2b395aea6ab0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$((3-\\sqrt{5})-(3+\\sqrt{5}))^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"185\" height=\"24\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/6/d160e96d5017f25198230ede09696e49e89eb3cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-2\\sqrt{5})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/c/73cced93395add9e5ee3bc35d693ce4c78c0d3a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying the first equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd6d7ae2be65d02a6145ccceb31a906e5e2c37a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/6/076c55912c614b1d904585558758a1315eaf963b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 x\\cdot\\log_2 y=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>From the second equation we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/c/dbc8215fcf5666b78985d8500f555b0d6511466b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 x+\\log_2 y = \\log_2 (xy) = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"235\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/e/1ee11c936d655a74f990b74c6b54eca5570b6315.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\log_2 \\frac{x}{y}\\right)^{2} = (\\log_2 x-\\log_2 y)^{2} = (\\log_2 x+\\log_2 y)^{2} - 4\\log_2 x\\cdot\\log_2 y = (6)^{2} - 4(4) = 20 \\Rightarrow \\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"737\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/a/09a5f873e447fc203f230be93f01e6bb9690153e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=\\log_2 x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/5322e9ba7aab880bde475fade02c4d18d933146a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=\\log_2 y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" />. \n</p><p>Writing the first given as \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/8/6e8d6e87e36d9c05983c6e8bfd8c38eaeffe79c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 x = \\frac{\\log_2 16}{\\log_2 y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"123\" height=\"42\" /> and the second as\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/b/c7b4fb069b49b30bdd50b79b44aa674b5bf852da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 x + \\log_2 y = \\log_2 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"186\" height=\"17\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/2/b42b05ed7fa2433b84f512c6ccf29a62fdc0e9b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A\\cdot B = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/f/dbfd395055cc084b0e6763402e54a3f4d73fde84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/2/942ecc4305be7a5b7c2fdc66cf33da7f02ba969b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 3 \\pm \\sqrt{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Our goal is to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/9/2b9620d2a39fad5b56bc94dc2ae7a1ae7206ad79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$( A-B )^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"19\" />. From the above, it is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/a/efabd9df464b39e1e8309cc5684af5c87babae2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6-2B) = \\left(2\\sqrt{5}\\right)^2 = 20 \\Rightarrow \\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"252\" height=\"35\" />.\n</p><p>Alternatively, once we found <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b44beb78e8be18179bfb7fe6b3424e7fb1aef32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/f/dbfd395055cc084b0e6763402e54a3f4d73fde84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A+B=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" />, we could have squared the latter to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/6/ff61e657a6e6f05ee53d5840df63f73447e84352.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A^2+B^2+2AB=36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"169\" height=\"18\" />; subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times the former equation, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/5/e45229f0ce329d28152babaabef76baa736220b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A^2+B^2-2AB=(A-B)^2=36-16=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"395\" height=\"30\" />. (Alternate finish by Technodoggo)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ODOWgzhVKog\">https://youtu.be/ODOWgzhVKog</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/RdIIEhsbZKw?t=1821\">https://youtu.be/RdIIEhsbZKw?t=1821</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A\">2019 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2019 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <